tengine/godot/pull/123602.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-30T01:31:08Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #123499\r\n\r\n`CompressedTexture2D` always returned `false/0` from `has_mipmaps()` and  `get_mipmap_count()`, because it didn't override the default methods from `Texture2D`.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"887\" height=\"550\" alt=\"Skärmavbild 2026-09-18 kl  11 05 43\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da908520-7dcd-45a5-a7e0-dba174bcdb8c\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe mipmap count is now stored from the image when the texture is loaded. `CompressedTexture2D` overrides both `has_mipmaps()` and  `get_mipmap_count()`. The count is also updated when the texture is reloaded.\r\n<img width=\"809\" height=\"529\" alt=\"Skärmavbild 2026-09-18 kl  11 55 36\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61c45b86-0824-4bd6-b18d-6caa5077ce3b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAI was used to explain the issue and help with following the contribution guidelines.\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR to Godot, so any feedback is welcome!","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin"